            "review_title": "Review at SIGNATURE by The Coffee House",
            "review_text": "maryyeo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4531 contributions\n0\nNot just good coffee, good food here too!\nJun 2023 • Family\nThe Coffee House can be found in almost every major neighborhoods in Vietnam, but SIGNATURE by The Coffee House seem to be their higher-end sister restaurant.\n\nOpen for only a few months in Crescent Mall, they're already drawing quite a crowd, especially for weekend brunches and afternoon teas.\n\nTheir Western dishes such as fries with caramelized onions and pulled pork and creamy Tom Yum spaghetti were really tasty, and they had a good variety of baked pastries, non-caffeinated concocted drinks and pretty-looking desserts too. Plenty of Vietnamese and other Asian set meals too.\n\nLove their coffee blends - true to its description, the Campfire coffee blend indeed tasted like smooth chocolate and burnt caramel - delicious!\nRead more\nWritten December 22, 2023",
